<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 311 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 311 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 311 million zlotys of the 273-day NBP-bills after banks bid for 311 million with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The bank sold the bills at the minimum price of 86.85. Due to technical problems the NBP was unable to immediately give the average price and average yield at this auction.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
